# What `gcloud builds submit` uploads to Cloud Build (it ignores .dockerignore for the upload itself).
# Whitelist: manuals, embeddings, eval data and local credentials never leave the laptop.
*
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!ingestion/
ingestion/__pycache__/
!api/
api/__pycache__/
# the agent's prompt, only (sg-api's leak check compares answers with it); never agent/storegear/.env
!agent/
agent/*
!agent/storegear/
agent/storegear/*
!agent/storegear/prompts/
agent/storegear/prompts/*
!agent/storegear/prompts/system_es.md
